# ArduPlane Parameters - Mini Talon Aggressive High-Wind CTE Stress Overlay
#
# WARNING: This is NOT the default Mini Talon airspeed overlay.
# The default Gazebo airspeed overlay is config/overlays/plane_airspeed.parm
# (conservative, production-like 14/10/22 cruise/min/max).
#
# This overlay is a deliberately named high-wind CTE STRESS profile. It raises
# the commanded cruise/min/max well above the production-like Mini Talon values
# so the aircraft keeps upwind ground-speed margin in the strong corners of a
# wind matrix. It is preserved for stress experiments only and is intentionally
# NOT wired into any launch target or wind-matrix/CTE default param stack.
#
# Provenance: these are the aggressive values that had previously leaked into
# config/overlays/plane_airspeed.parm. The accepted CTE wind-envelope evidence
# (evidence/reports/features/2026-06-02_cte_wind_envelope_result.md and
# docs/presentations/platform_briefing/cte_result_brief.md) is the
# production-like cruise=14 story, NOT this aggressive cruise=28 profile.
#
# To use this overlay, name it explicitly as a param-file stack member; do not
# rename it back over the default plane_airspeed.parm.
#
# One-source rule:
# - Gazebo provides wind
# - SITL wind remains disabled

ARSPD_TYPE       100       # JSON airspeed sensor from Gazebo / ArduPilotPlugin
ARSPD_USE        1
ARSPD_AUTOCAL    0         # Do not learn offset from live wind on startup
ARSPD_SKIP_CAL   1         # Keep startup from zeroing in active wind
ARSPD_OFFSET     0
ARSPD_OPTIONS    0         # Trust Gazebo JSON airspeed in deliberate high-wind tests
ARSPD_WIND_GATE  0         # Disable EKF/wind consistency disable-reenable cycling

# High-wind CTE profile.
# The 12/12 m/s matrix corner is a 16.97 m/s resultant wind, so the
# production-like 14 m/s cruise target could not make reliable upwind progress.
# This aggressive profile lifts the airspeed envelope above that wind magnitude.
AIRSPEED_CRUISE  28
AIRSPEED_MIN     18
AIRSPEED_MAX     38
TRIM_THROTTLE    75
TECS_SPDWEIGHT   1.2
TECS_CLMB_MAX    8
TECS_SINK_MAX    3
MIN_GROUNDSPEED  8
ROLL_LIMIT_DEG   30
NAVL1_PERIOD     22
NAVL1_LIM_BANK   25        # Loiter-only bank cap; waypoint turns use ROLL_LIMIT_DEG
TECS_PITCH_MIN   -5
TKOFF_THR_MAX    100
TKOFF_ROTATE_SPD 14
TECS_LAND_ARSPD  16
TECS_LAND_THR    65
STALL_PREVENTION 1

SIM_WIND_SPD     0
SIM_WIND_DIR     180
SIM_WIND_TURB    0
AHRS_WIND_MAX    35
